@bczhc 我们把你在 #53 的参数和这里的参数都换算成转角对比了一下：35 到 58 mm 之间相差不到 0.1°，外圈约 0.06 到 0.1°，正好和你看到的"最后三段一点点上翘"对得上。

差得最多的反而是最内圈：25 mm 处约 0.5°（沿轨约 0.24 mm）。想请教一下，你用这组参数刻的那张盘，最内一两圈的线是直的吗？如果方便的话，能拍一张内圈的特写就更好了。这对判断两种方法在内圈谁更准很有帮助。

@Sliicy Congratulations, and thanks for sharing this. Your grid looks clean in the photo, and five discs is a good outcome for a drive that took some work.

One note for anyone using this preset: discs with the same label can differ between batches, so a new batch may need its own measurement.

If you can tell me which LG drive this was, I'd like to add it to the disc-probe README with your result, as I asked on [disc-probe #1](https://github.com/Ashley-QwQ/disc-probe/issues/1#issuecomment-6676152065).

@Sliicy Thank you! That settles it: HL-DT-ST SP80NB80 (RC00) with MID `MCC 03RG20`. I'll add it to the disc-probe README table with your result.

This is a nice data point. On your `CMC MAG. AM3` disc, this drive was too noisy and `geo` stopped at the second step, and `--speed 3324` didn't slow it down. On this Verbatim disc, the same setting settled at about 1432 rpm and `geo` finished. So the disc makes a big difference on this drive, though I can't say why from these runs.

One more note for anyone using this preset: today [Lakida0 reported](https://github.com/JiaFeiMiao-K-Cat/DiscImageStudio/discussions/107#discussioncomment-19434982) discs with the same MID, though they aren't sure theirs are genuine. They measured inner 24.012 mm and outer 58.046 mm, against 23.991 mm and 57.936 mm here. So the same MID doesn't guarantee the same geometry, and it's worth checking a new batch.

@domerawind @bczhc 改成 2297888 是可行的，只是在 DIS 里不能只改扇区数。DIS 的预设靠内外半径和总扇区数一起确定轨距，只把总扇区数减 608、外半径不动，几何就变了：以内置的 `ritek-dvd-r-e-series` 为例，按恒定轨距算，全盘会差约 12 圈，图案就歪了。

外半径要跟着改成 `sqrt(r0² + (r1² - r0²) × 2297888 / 2298496)`，这个预设大约是从 58.2337 变成 58.2273 mm。这个预设还带轨距系数，所以这个公式只是近似。用 disc-probe 的话，`disexport --geo latest --sectors 2297888` 会按新的扇区数重新拟合，这样更准。

这个方法我算过，但没人实刻过正好 2297888 这个数，封盘正不正常还要实测。

@domerawind 太好了，谢谢！这下缺的那个实测有了：用 `disexport --sectors 2297888` 重新拟合的预设，在 RiDATA（RITEKF1）上封盘正常，图像也正常。

@JiaFeiMiao-K-Cat 这个 issue 到这里可以总结一下：

- 按 2,298,496 刻：图像完整，封盘报错（UJ272、DVR-S21，用户反馈）。
- 按 2,297,888 刻，且外半径和轨距系数按新扇区数重新拟合：封盘正常（一张盘）。
- 所以建议的改法还是那两条：空盘默认用可写扇区数（READ TRACK INFORMATION 的 free blocks），或者超出时提示。内置的 `ritek-dvd-r-e-series`（2,298,496）和 `dvd-5-80mm`（714,544）也许值得核对。只改扇区数会让图弯，domerawind 也提到过这一点，要连外半径和系数一起重算。

这 608 个扇区本身是开 overburn 才能写的部分，bczhc 已经解释过了，它在别的工具链上可以正常用。
